                        ],
                        "form": "heiled"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "358c6e5a-e8ea-47f2-9fd6-416b183a427a",
                        "entry_id": "922f23fd-a30c-36ec-bd1a-5466a43443d7",
                        "tags": [
                            "past",
                            "participle"
                        ],
                        "form": "heiling"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                        "entry_id": "922f23fd-a30c-36ec-bd1a-5466a43443d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "den Hitlergruß machen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a03f63f-b724-4fc9-818a-f21b5663bc44",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„Of course they should have realized it years ago when they where heiling the Führer.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0498006f-b355-45a1-8bf0-0fc0dc789ca3",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„Of late, however, Jews have been excluded from the »privilege« of raising their hand to heil either Fuehrer, Banner, or song.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1593858-cd17-4b08-a167-8d711493bff2",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„So pay off every cent you owe - and avoid making new debts as you'd avoid heiling Hilter!“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dda2bf14-5fd1-4e4a-aec1-16d058c6bcf0",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„When der fuehrer says: We is de master race | We heil (pffft) heil (pffft) right in Der Fuehrer's Face | Not to love der fuehrer is a great disgrace | So we heil (pffft) heil (pffft) right in Der Fuehrer's Face“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "732c9d82-baa1-4c26-aabd-e2057cf1d5d5",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„I heiled Hitler like everybody else.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0eecdd3-c432-4652-b0e9-b49da60936d8",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„Todd issued a statement that all G.I.'s should be entitled to see a circus in Nuremburg Stadium, once a favorite spot for heiling Hitler, and there should be some gimmicks around so that they would feel right at home.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cbe0a66-d069-4331-a727-c737ae28de60",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„Berlin was still full of Nazi uniforms; Parteigenossen went about heiling each other on the streets.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b472c821-37fc-4604-bc7e-ef5c9cbc2ad8",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„We would then all line up at the door, Ribbentrop would appear and greet us with a frozen smile, raise his hand in the heiling gesture, and rapidly enter his private car to be driven off.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1803e40e-32c9-4aed-ba2d-6a8bafb4c519",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„It must therefore be coincidental that he [Irving] found himself at the front of a sieg heiling mob of boneheads in Halle, east Germany in 1991; also that he was captured on stage with numerous neo-nazis under a banner reading »Wahrheit Macht Frei« (truth makes one free), a sick pun on the »Arbeit Macht Frei« (work makes one free) slogan displayed at Nazi concentration camps.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08e91aa3-c386-4a1e-b73d-7ec4bc2aebf9",
                                "sense_id": "76abd0e4-f655-3cd8-97e9-b9267c1c7ee3",
                                "text": "„I heiled and saluted and all that mummery, then told them I was there to obey orders.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
